@baseUrl = https://localhost:7146
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/interests
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Create an interest under a category
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Machine Learning",
  "categoryId": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-4012-9345-6789abcdef02",
  "createdBy": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6"
}

### Paginated interests filtered by one or more category IDs — no auth required
GET {{apiUrl}}/by-categories?categoryIds=d4e5f6a7-b8c9-4012-9345-6789abcdef02&categoryIds=e5f6a7b8-c9d0-4123-a456-789abcdef013&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Paginated interests — no auth required
GET {{apiUrl}}/pagination?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Search interests by name
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?name=Machine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
